y)=xy\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2y,$ then $D({x}^{3})=$" 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186078874 1074 "The given operator is a third-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{3}(x,y)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+{f}_{2}(x,y)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x,y)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x,y)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{3}=xy,{f}_{2}=0,{f}_{1}=y,$ and ${f}_{0}=2.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y={x}^{3}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D({x}^{3}) & =x({x}^{3})\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}({x}^{3})+{x}^{3}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3})+2{x}^{3} \\\\  & ={x}^{4}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(3{x}^{2})+{x}^{3}\\cdot 3{x}^{2}+2{x}^{3} \\\\  & ={x}^{4}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6x)+3{x}^{5}+2{x}^{3} \\\\  & ={x}^{3}\\cdot 6+3{x}^{5}+2{x}^{3} \\\\  & =6{x}^{4}+3{x}^{5}+2{x}^{3} \\\\  & ={x}^{3}(3{x}^{2}+6x+2)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186078875 1068 #edb/ref 17592186075998 13194139533416 17592186045585 false] [17592186078875 1068 #edb/ref 17592186310978 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186078875 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186078875 1071 "If $D(y) = y\\frac{d^{3}y}{dx^{3}} - xy\\frac{dy}{dx} + 2y$, then $D(\\sin x) =$" 13194139533416 17592186045585 false] [17592186078875 1071 "If $D(y)=y\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}-xy\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2y,$ then $D(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)=$" 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186078875 1074 "The given operator is a third-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{3}(x,y)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}+{f}_{2}(x,y)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x,y)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x,y)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{3}=y,{f}_{2}=0,{f}_{1}=-xy,$ and ${f}_{0}=2.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-x(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x(2-(x+1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083278 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311732 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083278 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311733 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083278 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311742 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083279 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311841 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083279 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311842 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083279 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311843 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083279 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311844 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083279 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311845 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083279 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311846 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083279 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311847 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083314 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311793 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083314 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311816 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083315 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311817 13194139533416 17592186045585 true] [17592186083315 1038 #edb/ref 17592186311818 13194139533416 17592186045585 t